{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T21:03:42.676Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"bed545a7a5ed9df9669e29b14534ad2269cc28038980812ec96f581e00089383","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","text":"I've scheduled the daily 07:45 Strategic pod brief, but it probably won't post tomorrow. I replied to Ruth in her thread in #strategic-random and said the same.\n\n- **First run date:** The scheduler thinks today is 24 Oct, so its first run is 25 Oct rather than 15 Oct.\n- **Gateway:** The scheduler's gateway isn't running, so the job won't fire at all until someone starts it.\n\nThe job is meant to summarise new messages from #strategic-pod, #strategic-random and #inc-vtg-hartford and post them in #strategic-random. Ruth, Gideon and Nadia are in all three channels, so they can already see everything it will summarise. It leaves out finance figures and anything from DMs.\n\nSomeone needs to fix both problems before 07:45 tomorrow. If that doesn't happen, there won't be a brief."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
